    "description": "Update the Cockpit pane the user supervises from: the current task, its plan steps and their status. Call it when you start a task of two or more steps, whenever a step starts, finishes or gets blocked, and with the full list each time (it replaces the previous one). Write task, steps and note in Hebrew. Never mark a step done that you did not finish and verify. Task, steps and note also carry over: the next session in this project is offered them as a handoff if the work is left unfinished."
   },
